                                "sense_id": "ccc0cb9c-7160-34fd-bc2a-38dfc54d0d40",
                                "text": "In the brouhaha over the reappointment of Superior Court Judge Sylvia Pressler, we organized massive support - telegramming, telephoning and writing to encourage the State Senate to exercise its advise and consent function responsibly."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e9762ba2-c410-4717-8875-2c9c0da397b6",
                                "sense_id": "ccc0cb9c-7160-34fd-bc2a-38dfc54d0d40",
                                "text": "More and more people agreed to help with the mailings, the hand-distribution of flyers, and telephonings. Others agreed to be gofers and fetchers."
